WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.073
- All right.
(audience applauding)

00:00:01.073 --> 00:00:02.640
It's almost that time, but before we go,

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.930
I have one more story to share.

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.085
This is "What I'm Liking".

00:00:05.085 --> 00:00:07.830
(audience applauds)
(funky music)

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:09.660
A young couple has made it their mission

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:12.090
to visit every country in the world,

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:13.290
and they are well on their way.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.123
This is so cool.

00:00:14.123 --> 00:00:16.980
So far, they've traveled to 112 countries,

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.820
which leaves about 80 more
to go, which is incredible.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:21.653
Along the way,

00:00:21.653 --> 00:00:23.760
the couple is documenting
their experience online.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:25.740
Let's get them in here right now.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:26.970
What's up, Emily?
(audience applauds)

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:27.870
What's up, Hudson?

00:00:28.787 --> 00:00:30.564
- Hi, Kelly!
- Hi, Kelly!

00:00:30.564 --> 00:00:31.560
Thank you so much

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.393
for having us.
- Oh my.

00:00:32.393 --> 00:00:34.380
Wait, where are you?

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.736
- We're in Thailand right now.

00:00:35.736 --> 00:00:37.230
This is one of our favorite countries.

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:39.420
The people and the food are incredible.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.130
So we'll be here in
Asia for the next month,

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:43.380
and then we're headed to West Africa next.

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:46.890
- And how this whole
thing for travel started

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:48.750
is we met in fifth grade.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.312
We started dating in high school.

00:00:50.312 --> 00:00:51.145
- What?!

00:00:51.145 --> 00:00:52.170
- But it was actually in college

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:54.660
when we came up with our initial goal

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:56.220
to buy this old RV

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:58.470
and set out to travel the 50 states.

00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:01.860
But then, after we got
married, a few years later,

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:04.860
my dad just suddenly passed
away from a heart attack.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:05.693
- [Kelly] Oh.

00:01:05.693 --> 00:01:06.540
- And that was just a reminder to us

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.970
that we're literally
not guaranteed tomorrow

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:10.680
and we wanna make the most of the time

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:12.060
that we have together.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:14.940
So that next year, we sold everything,

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.580
bought this old RV and renovated it,

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:20.880
and started traveling to the 50 states.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.680
But we just fell in love with travel

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:24.975
and now we're in our 112th country.

00:01:24.975 --> 00:01:26.723
(audience cheers)
- That's in-

00:01:26.723 --> 00:01:28.920
All of that that you
just said is incredible.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:31.590
The fact that you've known each
other since the fifth grade.

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:32.460
I didn't know that part.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:33.900
That's incredible.
(Hudson laughs)

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:34.920
Congratulations.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.540
Still like living your lives together.

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:37.373
That's incredible.
- [Hudson] Thank you.

00:01:37.373 --> 00:01:40.710
And also, like, just
such a cool, like, thing

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:41.790
and what a cool purpose to like,

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:43.020
go visit different cultures

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.580
and different places

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.770
and have these conversations
with different people.

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:48.120
This is an amazing thing.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:50.430
So let's get some rapid
fire recommendations.

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:52.650
Like Emily, prettiest country so far.

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:53.483
- Egypt.

00:01:53.483 --> 00:01:55.260
The pyramids were incredible.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.370
- [Hudson] Argentina,

00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:58.749
Patagonia is so beautiful.

00:01:58.749 --> 00:01:59.850
- Oh my god.

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:02.160
I think I'm gonna have to
agree with Hudson on that one.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.060
Okay.

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:03.893
Best-
(Hudson laughs)

00:02:03.893 --> 00:02:05.010
That picture, geez.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:05.880
Best food.

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:06.990
Where do you think, Hudson?

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:08.580
- Mexico for sure.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:11.400
- [Emily] And for me, Thailand
where we are right now.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:12.233
- Okay.
(Emily and Hudson laugh)

00:02:12.233 --> 00:02:13.320
The friendliest people.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.190
Where do you think?

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:16.470
- [Hudson] Middle Eastern hospitality

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:18.030
is definitely unmatched.

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:20.400
- We've been so inspired
by people's kindness

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.780
and hospitality all around the world,

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.550
but I'd have agree with the Middle East.

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:24.660
- Oh my God, that was-

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:25.950
I mean, you guys, your pictures.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:27.870
I hope you make a book or something

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:29.280
and like, let everybody
(Emily and Hudson laugh)

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:31.140
join in on that by looking at it, it's so,

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:32.326
it's so incredible.
- Thank you so much.

00:02:32.326 --> 00:02:33.330
- These pictures.

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:34.230
Congratulations on

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:35.063
everywhere you've been
(audience applauds)

00:02:35.063 --> 00:02:37.462
and you're about to still go to.

00:02:37.462 --> 00:02:39.720
That's the coolest thing ever.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.040
You're like my favorite couple.

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:41.873
I'm liking your post-
- [Emily] Thank you so much.

00:02:41.873 --> 00:02:43.051
- Right now.

00:02:43.051 --> 00:02:44.730
(heart button chimes)
- We are so inspired by you,

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:47.100
Kelly, thank you so much for having us.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:47.933
- Absolutely.

00:02:47.933 --> 00:02:48.766
Well that's not all.

00:02:48.766 --> 00:02:49.680
Our season-long partner,

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:51.360
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:53.040
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:56.160
want to honor truly unstoppable
people just like y'all.

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.210
So they're gonna write y'all a check

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:58.874
for a thousand dollars to help y'all out.

00:02:58.874 --> 00:03:00.454
(audience cheers)

00:03:00.454 --> 00:03:01.663
- Oh my god, that's so nice.
- You're so kind.

00:03:02.987 --> 00:03:04.166
- Thank you so much!

00:03:04.166 --> 00:03:05.023
- Thank you guys so much.

00:03:05.023 --> 00:03:06.570
Y'all have so much fun.

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:08.160
And thank you to all our guests today.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.830
Cara Delevingne, Nicholas Sparks,

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.431
Jen Goodrich, Shandy Rice,

00:03:12.431 --> 00:03:13.966
Dachiana, and JORDY.

00:03:13.966 --> 00:03:15.090
Y'all have a great day and if it's not,

